{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cubiw Dungeron is a <strong>roguelike</strong> where you control a smiling cube that has to destroy more cubes inside the dungeon, while grabbing items that make you stronger to overcome the progressively tougher rooms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the dungeon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dungeon, formed of multiple rooms,\u00a0different every time you play, every 10 rooms you will fight against a boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-3 areas with 2 bosses each</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-30 different enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-75 different items with unique variations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-More than 200 room combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-And more to come in the future</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983230?t=1757871143","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983230?t=1757871143","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/aa659a95a9308a72b2c9c2d452be50831790524d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757871143","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983230/aa659a95a9308a72b2c9c2d452be50831790524d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757871143","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cubiw Dungeron is a <strong>roguelike</strong> where you control a smiling cube that has to destroy more cubes inside the dungeon, while grabbing items that make you stronger to overcome the progressively tougher rooms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the dungeon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dungeon, formed of multiple rooms,\u00a0different every time you play, ev